e;white-space:pre-wrap;\">•</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Utilizing planning tools and change management for successful project execution.</span></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Module 9: Project Scope Management</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">•</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Defining project scope clearly and accurately.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">•</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Creating a Work Breakdown Structure (WBS) and identifying tasks.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">•</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Managing the schedule and organizing activities.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">•</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Estimating tasks using techniques like PERT and managing timing effectively.</span></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Module 10: Traditional vs. Agile Project Management Mindset</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">•</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Understanding the differences between traditional and agile project management.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">•</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Exploring tools and techniques for schedule development.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">•</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Analyzing how team culture affects project success and improving the work environment.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">•</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Managing change using both traditional and agile methods.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Key Technical Terms Related to the Project Management Professional PMP Course</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">•</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Project Management Terms</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">• </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Predictive Project Management Terms</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">•</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Develop Project Charter</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">• </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Agile Principles and Mindset</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">• </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Professional Responsibility and Ethics</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">•</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Project Management Principles & Applications</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">•</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> PM Performance Domains</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">•</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Traditional vs Agile Mindset</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">•</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Major Outputs by Process Groups</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">•</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Preparing for the PMP Exam</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Frequently Asked Questions</span></h2><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">What are some essential Project Management Terms every PMP candidate should know?</span></h3><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Scope:</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Defines project boundaries and deliverables.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Stakeholders:</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Individuals or organizations affected by the project.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Baseline:</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> The approved plan for scope, schedule, and cost.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Constraints:</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Limitations such as time, budget, and resources.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">What is Predictive Project Management and when is it applied?</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Predictive (or Waterfall) Project Management follows a sequential, plan-driven approach, best suited for projects with well-defined requirements such as construction or manufacturing.</span></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">How do Agile Principles and Mindset differ from traditional approaches?</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Agile emphasizes adaptability, iterative progress, customer collaboration, and responding to change, while traditional (predictive) approaches focus on detailed upfront planning and sequential execution.</span></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">How do Traditional vs Agile Mindsets compare?</span></h3><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Traditional Mindset: </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Plan-driven, structured, predictive</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Agile Mindset:</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Value-driven, flexible, iterative, focused on customer satisfaction and adaptability.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">What are the major outputs by Process Groups in project management?</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Initiating: </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Project Charter, Stakeholder Register</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Planning: </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Scope Statement, WBS, Schedule, Cost Baseline.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Executing: </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Deliverables, Team Assignments</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Monitoring & Controlling: </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Performance Reports, Change Requests.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Closing:</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> Final Product, Lessons Learned, Closure Report.</span></p></blockquote>', '[\" Gain comprehensive knowledge of global project management standards \",\" Master planning and execution techniques for on-time, on-budget delivery\",\" Boost your career prospects with a globally respected certification \",\"Improve leadership and communication skills\",\"Apply both Agile and traditional management practices \",\"Use modern project tools for tracking and optimization\",\" Understand professional responsibility and ethics \",\"Be prepared for senior roles, including CEO-level leadership\",\"Enhance your competitive edge in tech and telecom projects \",\"Build a professional network in the project management field\",\"Increase your salary potential with higher qualifications \"]', '{\"How long will I have access to the PMP course? \":\"You will have lifetime access to the course in your account, allowing you to revisit and review anytime, at your own pace.\",\"How do I stay updated with changes in the telecom and PM industry?\":\"We regularly update our courses to include the latest developments in telecom and project management. You\\u2019ll automatically receive updated content\\r\\n\",\"Do I receive a certificate after completing the course?\":\"Yes! Upon completing all required activities\\u2014including practical projects and the final exam, you\\u2019ll receive a certified completion certificate featuring your name, the course title, and completion date.\\r\\n\"}', 'english', 3, 6, '[]', '[\" A genuine interest in or aspiration to work in project management\",\"Basic computer and office software skills (Excel, Word)\",\" Commitment to follow an intensive theoretical and practical course\",\" A quiet environment and dedicated time for focused learning\"]', 339, NULL, 0, 'advanced', '1', NULL, 'https://vimeo.com/1175467306', 1754431200, 1775031955, 'general', 1, 1, 'upcoming', 'vimeo', 'Project Management Professional (PMP) Course', 'The Project Management Professional (PMP) course is an important step for everyone seeking to achieve excellence in the field of project management and understand the advantages to have.', NULL, 0, 1, 1, NULL, '715bea698102054dcac7277a846af92d.jpg', '2025-11-30T09:42');
INSERT INTO `course` (`id`, `title`, `short_description`, `description`, `outcomes`, `faqs`, `language`, `category_id`, `sub_category_id`, `section`, `requirements`, `price`, `discount_flag`, `discounted_price`, `level`, `user_id`, `thumbnail`, `video_url`, `date_added`, `last_modified`, `course_type`, `is_top_course`, `is_admin`, `status`, `course_overview_provider`, `meta_keywords`, `meta_description`, `is_free_course`, `multi_instructor`, `enable_drip_content`, `creator`, `expiry_period`, `upcoming_image_thumbnail`, `publish_date`) VALUES
(9, 'Integrated Data Analysis Track', 'The first integrated data analysis track of its kind in the Arab world! Learn Excel, SQL, Python, and Power BI in a hands-on and professional way with Engineer Issa Melhem', '<p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: 700; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">From Data Browser to Multi-Tool Professional Data Analyst — That’s the Real Transformation Brought to You by the Integrated Data Analysis Track!</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">An all-inclusive package that takes you from absolute zero in the world of data to mastering four powerful tools that are in high demand across global job markets: Excel, Power BI, Python, and SQL.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">This is because data analysis is one of the most in-demand and rapidly growing fields across all industries worldwide in business, marketing, healthcare, and even government sectors. Data is the essential fuel for making smart decisions, creating opportunities, and identifying future trends. This is where the Integrated Data Analysis Track becomes a turning point in our academy’s journey toward empowering the new generation of professionals in today’s fast-paced world of data analytics.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">This track offers trainees the opportunity to gain a deep and comprehensive understanding of statistical analysis, the ability to create advanced interactive dashboards, and efficiently handle large datasets. They will also master writing professional SQL queries. The track aims to practically and proficiently qualify trainees to meet the demands of the job market in data analysis, business, and technology, equipping them to deliver innovative and effective analytical solutions.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The program is designed in an interactive, hands-on style that focuses on direct training. Through real-life exercises, practical projects, and working with actual datasets, trainees gain valuable field experience that enhances their skills and prepares them to confidently face workplace challenges.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">General Objectives of the Track</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">This track is designed to provide trainees with strong, in-demand expertise by combining modern tools with advanced analytical methodologies, delivered through an interactive and practical learning experience.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The course aims to achieve the following:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Build a strong foundation from scratch using Excel, SQL, Python, and Power BI.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Master applied statistical analysis.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Design and build interactive dashboards.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Handle and analyze large datasets using SQL and Python.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Provide practical preparation for labor market requirements.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Build a strong professional portfolio.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Enhance analytical thinking and decision-making skills.</span></p></li></ul><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-left: 18pt;text-indent: -18pt;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Who Benefits from the Integrated Data Analysis Track ?</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">As part of its core objectives, this unique track serves a wide audience of data analysis enthusiasts from various backgrounds and disciplines—whether beginners or those looking to enhance their data analysis skills for more effective use in their fields</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Individuals aspiring to enter the field of data analysis.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p di