p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Optical Amplifiers</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> DWDM (Dense Wavelength Division Multiplexing) </span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Coherent Optics </span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Cable-Laying Ships </span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> ROVs (Remotely Operated Vehicles)</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Sea Plow</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> SLTE (Submarine Line Terminal Equipment)</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> OptiX OSN 9800</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Infinera XTC-10 </span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> AOLM-500 / SOLM-500</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> RAU2 (Remote Amplifier Unit) </span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> MAREA Cable System </span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> 2Africa Cable</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> SDM (Space Division Multiplexing)</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Open ROADM</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> C+L Bands</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Cable Termination Equipment</span></p></li></ul><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Frequently Asked Questions</span></h2><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">What role do Optical Fibers play in submarine cable systems?</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Optical fibers are the core medium for transmitting high-speed data signals across oceans using the principle of Total Internal Reflection, enabling low-loss communication over long distances.</span></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">How does Total Internal Reflection enable long-distance data transmission in submarine cables?</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">It ensures that light signals are reflected within the fiber core, preventing signal leakage into the cladding and allowing efficient transmission across thousands of kilometers.</span></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">What is DWDM and why is it essential in submarine cable systems?</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">DWDM (Dense Wavelength Division Multiplexing) allows multiple data channels, each at different wavelengths, to be transmitted simultaneously over a single fiber, maximizing bandwidth capacity.</span></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">What is SLTE in submarine cable systems?</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">SLTE (Submarine Line Terminal Equipment) is located at landing stations and handles optical signal transmission, multiplexing, and monitoring between terrestrial networks and undersea cables.</span></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Can you give examples of modern submarine cable systems?</span></h3><p style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:24pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-bf7ef036-7fff-929d-6d68-7c6ed5f851d8\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">MAREA Cable System: </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Connects the U.S. and Spain, known for high-capacity transatlantic transmission.</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">2Africa Cable: </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">One of the largest projects, connecting Africa, Europe, and the Middle East.</span></p>', '[\"The ability to understand the design and planning of submarine cable routes.\",\" Comprehensive knowledge of DWDM systems and the equipment used in submarine cable terminal stations (SLTE).\",\" Deep understanding of data transmission technologies through optical fibers and the management of optical signals. \",\"Practical skills in operating and maintaining submarine cables using the latest equipment and technologies.\"]', '{\"Can I take the SUBMARINE cable course while working?\":\"Yes, the course is designed to be flexible because:\\r\\n- Sessions are recorded for later viewing.\\r\\n- Exercises can be completed at your own pace.\\r\\n\",\"How can I contact the instructors to resolve inquiries?\":\" - Weekly live Q&A sessions. \\r\\n- Private WhatsApp groups for trainees to answer technical questions 24\\/7. \\r\\n- Continuous technical support with a professional team for practical issues.\"}', 'english', 3, 5, '[]', '[\"Familiarity with the basics of telecommunications networks \",\" General knowledge of fiber optic technologies \",\" Interest in the field of submarine cables\",\"Background in electrical engineering and electronics\"]', 249, NULL, 0, 'advanced', '1', NULL, 'https://vimeo.com/1175467087', 1757883600, 1775032701, 'general', 0, 1, 'upcoming', 'vimeo', 'Submarine Cables  Course', 'The SUBMARINE Cable Course combines advanced technologies with practicality to qualify you to work efficiently in data transmission', NULL, 0, 0, 1, NULL, '6ac5d180fdc56f38d4b9b356af45f91a.jpg', '2025-12-15T11:27');
INSERT INTO `course` (`id`, `title`, `short_description`, `description`, `outcomes`, `faqs`, `language`, `category_id`, `sub_category_id`, `section`, `requirements`, `price`, `discount_flag`, `discounted_price`, `level`, `user_id`, `thumbnail`, `video_url`, `date_added`, `last_modified`, `course_type`, `is_top_course`, `is_admin`, `status`, `course_overview_provider`, `meta_keywords`, `meta_description`, `is_free_course`, `multi_instructor`, `enable_drip_content`, `creator`, `expiry_period`, `upcoming_image_thumbnail`, `publish_date`) VALUES
(15, 'Integrated Telecommunications Engineering Course', 'Comprehensive Integrated Communications Engineering Course for Radio Communications and Transmission via Microwave and Optical Communications', '<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">He who knows the signal holds the keys to telecommunications engineering, and the rest comes with learning and persistence!</span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Integrated Telecommunications Engineering Course is a specialized training opportunity for engineers in the field of telecommunications and networks, aimed at providing a comprehensive understanding of wireless system behavior from transmitter to receiver. The course also includes explanations of fundamental concepts such as radio wave propagation and the impact of environmental factors, in addition to analyzing the evolution of telecommunications generations from 2G to 5G, and technologies such as SISO and MIMO.</span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The course focuses on the practical aspect through a case study of building an integrated wireless network using modern equipment, enabling trainees to acquire skills in designing and implementing effective coverage.</span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">By the end of the course, participants will be qualified to achieve professional performance that opens up wide opportunities for them in the telecommunications market.</span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Learn about the sections of the Integrated Telecommunications Engineering Course, as well as its most important axes!</span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Course Objectives</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> This course aims to achieve effective benefits for students in their professional lives. In this context, My Communication Academy highlights the most important benefits you will gain after passing the course:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Building a strong knowledge base in telecommunications engineering.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Making informed decisions to develop your professional or academic career path.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Understanding the integrated technical and administrative solutions used in institutions.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Finding or developing ideas for graduation projects to stand out if you are still a student at a telecommunications engineering college.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Acquiring experiences that qualify you for distinguished job opportunities.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Preparing a professional and strong CV.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Learning technical research skills, as well as problem-solving using the best methods.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">An accredited certificate that increases your chances of employment.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Taking advantage of direct weekly meetings with the instructor.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Receiving free consultations and continuous follow-up via WhatsApp.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Broad familiarity with integrated telecommunications concepts and services.</span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Beneficiaries of the Integrated Telecommunications Engineering Course</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> The Integrated Telecommunications Engineering Course is designed to open up professional opportunities for the trainee that would require decades of experience for an average engineer to achieve! This course targets a group of professional and academic categories that will greatly benefit from the course content, including:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Fresh graduate telecommunications students and engineers.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Radio planning engineers.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Coverage tower design engineers.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tower maintenance engineers.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Network engineering students.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Information technology and computer students and engineers.</span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">What do you need to start the course?</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> The Integrated Telecommunications Engineering Course is designed to suit ambitious engineers, so all you need to start is:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">A passion for the field of telecommunications and networks.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">General knowledge of telecommunications systems (2G-5G).</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Analytical thinking and curiosity to understand how signals travel, as well as the impact of surrounding factors.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">A personal computer and a stable internet connection.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Readiness for practical application and weekly follow-up to ensure the best benefit.</span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">What are the sections of the Integrated Telecommunications Engineering Course?</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> The Integrated Telecommunications Engineering Course provided by My Communication Academy is divided into three main sections that together form the most important system for a telecommunications engineer, enabling them to secure job opportunities and excel in their field. As they progress through the course, they will notice a remarkable development in their ambitions and deep understanding of their specialty, to understand integrated networks accurately, as well as how to integrate wired and wireless networks.</span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The sections of the Integrated Telecommunications Engineering Course are:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Wireless</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Optical Fiber Transmission</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Microwave Transmission</span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">What are the most important axes of the Integrated Telecommunications Engineering Course provided by My Communication?</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> The most important axes of the Integrated Telecommunications Engineering course provided by My Communication are those that distinguish each section of the course, and here are the most prominent ones:</span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">What is Wireless and what are its axes?</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> The term \"Wireless\" in the field of telecommunications refers to the behavior of the wireless system in transmitting information between the sender and the receiver without the need for wires. This also includes studying the main elements that make up this system and the function of each one in telecommunications engineering. To clarify these concepts practically, it will be explained using real-life examples through field training in some countries, where modern equipment and technologies were used to build integrated wireless systems. The course includes main axes in this field, which will be explained in detail:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Introduction:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Definition of the course and its objectives, the importance of the telecommunications engineering specialty in modern technology, in addition to the necessity of commitment and discipline at the beginning of the course, and a review of the educational content that will be covered.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Engineer Mentality:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Understanding the mental orientations that an engineer should adopt to build a professional mindset by mastering analytical thinking and problem-solving in the field of telecommunications.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Wireless Domains:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Identifying the various sections and fields of wireless communications, as well as their different types.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Knowledge and Learning Process:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> How to absorb knowledge and apply it effectively in various telecommunications projects, as well as focusing on developing skills and strategies through continuous learning in the technical telecommunications field.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">What You Need To Start:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Identifying the basic tools and resources that an engineer needs to start in the field of wireless communications, as well as achieving success in this developing field.</span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">As for the details of these axes, they are:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Wireless Basics:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Studying the fundamental principles of wireless communication technologies and how they work at various technical levels, and explaining frequency and frequency bands in wireless networks.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Wireless Development History:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Viewing the history of wireless communications from their beginnings to the latest technologies such as 5G and how this required field has developed.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">OFDM Technology:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> A detailed explanation of Orthogonal Frequency Division Multiplexing (OFDM) technology and how it is used to improve the efficiency of wireless networks.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Mobile Communication Basics:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Explaining concepts such as Band, Bandwidth, Carrier, and Cell. In addition to the basic principles of mobile communications, how mobile phones and the networks that manage them work, and how to calculate the number of sectors in cellular communications.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Base Station:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Identifying the base stations that form the heart of wireless networks, and explaining the main components in base stations such as the Base Band Unit (BBU) and the Radio Frequency (RF) module, and most importantly, the design of the base station and its installation basics.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">5G:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Studying 5G technology and the latest innovations it offers in the field of telecommunications. What is the need of networks for the fifth generation? What are the most important 5G applications such as EMBB, MMTC, and URLLC? As well as 5G frequencies and technologies: FR1 and FR2 as stated in 3GPP. In addition to explaining the integrated 5G network architecture and the technologies it supports such as Massive MIMO, Beamforming, Millimeter Waves, and others.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">5G Differences with Previous Generations:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> A comparison between 5G and previous generations, focusing on improvements in speed, capacity, and network efficiency. Why do 5G networks rely on TDD technology?</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Also:</span></p></li><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:circle;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"2\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Building a Base Station:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Learning how to build a telecommunications tower from A to Z, including engineering and environmental considerations and practical steps for building a telecommunications tower.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:circle;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"2\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Site Survey:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Studying how to conduct a field survey for a new site and the factors for choosing it to determine the best locations for establishing base stations and towers.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:circle;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"2\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Base Station Components:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Exploring the various tower components such as types of antennas and their installation techniques, power converters, routers, and their role in improving performance.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:circle;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"2\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Wireless Planning:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Types of planning and the tools used in this field to meet the required performance and coverage needs.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:circle;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"2\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Power and Gain Calculations:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Understanding how to calculate power and gain for each technology in wireless networks and how to improve them to get the best possible performance.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:circle;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"2\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Simulation Tools:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Studying the simulation tools used in designing wireless networks and how to use them in planning for network coverage and testing, such as Atoll.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:circle;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"2\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Antenna Installation:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Explaining how to install antennas and cables on towers and point them correctly to get the best coverage and signal quality.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:circle;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"2\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Signal Quality Testing:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Understanding advanced methods for testing signal quality in wireless networks, site adjustment, and analyzing results to ensure optimal performance.</span></p></li></ul></ul><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">What is optical fiber communication, and what are the axes of the Optical Fiber Transmission section?</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Optical fiber communication is one of the most important means of transmitting information in the current era. Through the Integrated Telecommunications Engineering course, you will acquire the skills that will enable you to become one of the most important telecommunications engineers in the job market, as you will be able to supervise projects and organize work teams to implement the largest telecommunications projects on the ground. Below are the most important basic axes that you will learn in this section:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Introduction to Fiber Optic Networks:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> An overview of the importance of fiber optic networks in improving communication speed and efficiency.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">PON Technology (Passive Optical Networks):</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Explaining how PON technology allows the distribution of the internet at high speeds and lower costs.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Fiber Types:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Clarifying the difference between Single Mode and Multi-Mode fibers and how to choose the most suitable one for each application.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Optical Communication Frequencies:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> The importance of using appropriate frequencies to obtain the best performance in data transmission.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">WDM Technology:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> How WDM technology helps in increasing network capacity by dividing the signal into several optical channels.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">DWDM Technology (Dense Wavelength Division Multiplexing):</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Explaining the working mechanism of DWDM, as well as its application in high-density networks to achieve maximum benefit from the infrastructure.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Basic Components in WDM:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Identifying the components used in this technology, as well as their role in improving the efficiency of optical networks.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Losses and Dispersion:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Explaining the problems that may affect signal quality such as attenuation and dispersion, as well as how to reduce them.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Fiber Optic Signal Control:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> The tools and mechanisms used to adjust optical signals to ensure stability and accuracy.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Optical Network Design:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> How to design a high-efficiency fiber optic network that supports future expansion, as well as maintains performance.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Fiber Optic Splicing:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Explaining splicing techniques, as well as the importance of accuracy in this process to maintain signal strength and reduce losses.</span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Microwave section and its axes in Integrated Telecommunications Engineering</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> The Microwave section is one of the most important sections of the Integrated Telecommunications Engineering course, as many telecommunications engineering jobs in the job market are based on it. It is also considered one of the most important telecommunications engineering courses that an engineer dreams of mastering in a way that builds their experience and capabilities to be a leader in their field at all levels. Among the most important axes of Microwave Transmission are:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Introduction to Microwave Transmission:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> The basics and fundamental concepts of microwave technologies and how to use them in transmitting data over long distances in telecommunications networks.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">MW vs Optical:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Explaining the different types of transmission between Microwave Transmission and Optical Transmission, i.e., a comparison between microwave and fiber optic technologies, as well as focusing on the advantages and disadvantages of each technology, and how to choose the most suitable one based on different requirements.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Microwave System Components:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Identifying the microwave frame structure and network topology in addition to types of microwave antennas, as well as all the main components of the microwave system such as antennas, transmitters, receivers, and ground stations and their role in improving performance.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Link Design Calculations:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> How to conduct design calculations for microwave links to ensure a stable and secure connection between stations.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Fresnel Zones:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> An explanation of the Fresnel zone concept and how it affects communication quality in microwave networks, as well as how to avoid related problems.</span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Also, the following skills:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Network Optimization:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Strategies for improving microwave network performance, including techniques for improving coverage and reducing negative effects such as interference and signal loss.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Loss and Power Calculations:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Understanding how to calculate losses resulting from interference, dispersion, and other environmental factors, as well as how to calculate power in microwave systems to ensure communication efficiency.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Microwave Integration:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> How the microwave system is integrated with other networks such as wired and wireless networks to ensure the harmony and effectiveness of the system.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">NLOS Problem Solving:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Strategies for addressing NLOS (Non-Line-of-Sight) problems, as well as how to deal with obstacles that affect the signal in non-ideal environments. A telecommunications engineer understands Line-of-Sight (LOS) well and identifies different LOS scenarios such as NLOS and nLOS, as well as how to improve KPIs.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Document Preparation:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Learning how to prepare integrated technical documents, including design reports, network performance monitoring, as well as documents for installation and maintenance, and all necessary documents regarding Microwave Transmission so that the student can design, implement, and explore microwave communication systems professionally.</span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">After talking about the main axes of the Integrated Telecommunications Engineering course, let us now move to a very important part of the Integrated Telecommunications Engineering course, which is the CV and Project Management courses. They were designed specifically to ensure your complete success in the job market. Because it is not enough to be just an engineer, you must move to a new level of professionalism and become a highly qualified engineer capable of dealing with the biggest challenges in the field, thanks to the best training and education methods.</span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Course Contents:</span></p><p data-path-to-node=\"0\"><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-b04ee1f0-7fff-bf06-fae5-f16c11debdca\"><br></b></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Project Management Process:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Studying the different stages of project management from the idea to delivery.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tools and Techniques:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Identifying the tools and programs used to manage projects efficiently, such as scheduling and tracking tools.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Project Management Principles:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> The basic values and principles that guide a project manager to ensure success and productivity.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Risk Management in Projects:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> How to identify potential risks in a project, as well as developing plans to reduce them.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Quality Management:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Strategies for ensuring the maintenance of high-quality standards during all stages of the project.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Reporting and Project Review:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> How to provide effective reports to stakeholders and regular review to ensure the project is proceeding in the right direction.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Steps for PMP Exam Success:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Strategies for successful preparation for the PMP exam, as well as how to succeed in passing it.</span></p></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Building a Project Execution Plan:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#6c757d;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> How to develop an effective execution plan that ensures the project is implemented successfully according to specifications, as well as the specified schedule.</span></p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node=\"0\"><br></p>', '[\"Comprehensive understanding of wireless, fiber, and microwave networks. \",\"Access to technical support and mentorship via WhatsApp.\",\"Ability to integrate wired and wireless systems efficiently. \",\"Network performance analysis and efficient design skills.\",\" Hands-on experience through real-world telecom projects. Professional CV creation and project management knowledge. Fluency in technical terminology and engineering communication. \",\"Certified diploma recognized in the job market. \"]', '{\"Q: Do I need prior experience?\":\"A: No, the course starts from basics and builds up gradually.\",\"Q: Is the certificate useful in the job market?\":\" A: Absolutely, it is accredited and can be added to your LinkedIn profile.\",\"Q: Is there a practical component? \":\"A: Yes, over 60% of the course is hands-on with design, testing, and planning tools.\"}', 'english', 3, 5, '[17,19,20,21,22,23,24,25,31,53,54,55,56,57,58,59,60,61]', '[\"Passion for telecom and networking. \",\"Basic understanding of 2G\\u20135G communication systems.\",\"Personal computer and stable internet connection. \",\" Analytical thinking and curiosity about signal transmission. \",\"Commitment to projects and weekly progress.\"]', 1200, NULL, 0, 'advanced', '1', NULL, 'https://vimeo.com/1175467260', 1757883600, 1782909380, 'general', 0, 1, 'active', 'vimeo', 'Integrated Telecommunications Engineering Course ', 'Comprehensive Integrated Communications Engineering Course for Radio Communications and Transmission via Microwave and Optical Communications', NULL, 0, 0, 1, NULL, '19fc1e92e17209cb728bac109cd7be1b.jpg', '2025-11-30T12:01');
INSERT INTO `course` (`id`, `title`, `short_description`, `description`, `outcomes`, `faqs`, `language`, `category_id`, `sub_category_id`, `section`, `requirements`, `price`, `discount_flag`, `discounted_price`, `level`, `user_id`, `thumbnail`, `video_url`, `date_added`, `last_modified`, `course_type`, `is_top_course`, `is_admin`, `status`, `course_overview_provider`, `meta_keywords`, `meta_description`, `is_free_course`, `multi_instructor`, `enable_drip_content`, `creator`, `expiry_period`, `upcoming_image_thumbnail`, `publish_date`) VALUES
(16, 'Telecom CV Course', 'Communications Engineer Resume | How to write a successful resume that catches the eye of employers. With the most important guidelines for creating a professional LinkedIn profile!', '<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Cambria,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">A telecommunications engineer may possess the skills and experience, yet stumble at the very first step: how to present themselves in the right way.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Cambria,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The course “The Telecom Engineer’s CV” by My Communication Academy is designed to help you build a complete professional image that reflects your capabilities and opens doors to the opportunities you deserve.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Cambria,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">This comprehensive journey begins with crafting an outstanding CV, followed by smart preparation for job interviews, building a compelling portfolio that reflects your skills, and establishing a professional presence on LinkedIn. It also covers strategies to pass both technical and personality assessments and provides practical guidance for negotiating the best job offers.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Cambria,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Whether you\'re just starting out or aiming for your next career leap, this course equips you with the tools you need to start with confidence and excellence.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Course Objectives</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Cambria,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">By the end of this course, participants will acquire key skills, including</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Cambria,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Cambria,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Writing a winning CV that grabs employers’ attention.</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Cambria,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Cambria,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Learning how to build an effective professional portfolio.</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Cambria,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Cambria,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Successfully passing job interviews.</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Cambria,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Cambria,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Developing a strong digital professional presence on LinkedIn.</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Cambria,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Cambria,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Negotiating for the best job offers.</span></p><p><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-4befe9b0-7fff-6bf6-e047-662c8aee854d\"><br></b></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Who Will Benefit from This Course ?</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Cambria,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">This course is designed to benefit:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Cambria,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Telecommunications engineers seeking new job opportunities.</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Cambria,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Cambria,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Engineering students aiming to enhance their professional skills.</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Cambria,serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-va