G) that utilize modulation and coding techniques to improve communication efficiency.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3900000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">4.Communication Systems Engineer: </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Responsible for designing systems that use modulation and coding techniques, analyzing their performance, and ensuring their continuity.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3900000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">5.5G/4G Technology Expert:</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Specializes in the latest generations of communications, specifically working with the modulation and coding techniques used in 4G and 5G.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3900000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">6.Researcher in Modulation and Coding Techniques</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos;color:#000000;ba