ocs-internal-guid-3245df94-7fff-476c-85fc-c0b603e5683d\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-dea1b63c-7fff-9eb8-6ae5-68365a715039\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-6746767d-7fff-cd4f-0728-b7a156cbd551\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">8.Telecommunications Project Manager:</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> Manages projects that involve implementing </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3900000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-82bbaacd-7fff-32fe-7d15-69b231a2e6d5\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-3ef1c216-7fff-8c72-1967-b71573933eb4\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-3245df94-7fff-476c-85fc-c0b603e5683d\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-6746767d-7fff-cd4f-0728-b7a156cbd551\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span></span><br></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></p>', '[\"Understanding of Fundamental Modulation and Coding Techniques: \\u25cf How different modulation techniques (AM, FM, PM, ASK, FSK, PSK) work and their application in data transmission across various channels. \\u25cf The ability to compare the performance of different modulation schemes used in various generations (2G, 3G, 4G, 5G). \\u25cf How modulation techniques are used to improve communication reliability and data transmission efficiency.\",\"Analyzing the Impact of Modulation and Coding on System Performance: \\u25cf The ability to evaluate how these techniques affect data transmission efficiency, spectral usage, and error rate reduction. \\u25cf Using advanced modulation and coding techniques to improve overall system performance.\",\"Practical Application in Real Work Environments: \\u25cf The ability to evaluate the performance of modulation and coding techniques in different practical work scenarios. \\u25cf Solving problems that may arise when applying these techniques in the field.\",\"Evaluating and Selecting Appropriate Modulation and Coding Schemes: \\u25cf The ability to evaluate the performance of different modulation and coding schemes and select the most appropriate one based on system requirements. \\u25cf How to design and implement communication systems using specific modulation and coding techniques based on their advantages and requirements.\"]', '{\"Do I need prior experience in the field of communications?    \":\" No, the course is suitable for beginners. It starts with the basic concepts of modulation and coding and progresses to advanced concepts.\",\"How do I get the certificate?     \":\"The certificate is certified by My-Communication Academy. You will receive a personal certificate linked to your LinkedIn profile after completing the course requirements.\",\"What are the job opportunities after this course?  \":\"You will be qualified for jobs in modulation and coding techniques, analyzing the impact of these techniques on system performance, data efficiency, and applying advanced coding techniques to improve communication reliability.\",\"Can I study the course while working?     \":\"Yes, the course is designed to be flexible. You can watch the recorded sessions at your convenience and are not required to attend live sessions.\"}', 'english', 3, 5, '[]', '[\"Basic mathematical concepts (concepts like Signal-to-Noise Ratio) \",\"A general understanding of concepts like frequency and bandwidth, as in communications or networks. \",\" A desire to work in the field of telecommunications and network projects.\"]', 299, NULL, 0, 'advanced', '7', NULL, '', 1758920400, 1760975313, 'general', 0, 0, 'upcoming', '', 'Modulation and Coding Techniques Course', '', NULL, 1, 0, 7, NULL, '9219bce3003b6c3c4a9ecb8b1bccc2e2.jpg', '2025-11-23T16:22');
