INSERT INTO `frontend_settings` (`id`, `key`, `value`) VALUES
(1, 'banner_title', 'Practical Expertise for Your Telecom Futures'),
(2, 'banner_sub_title', 'From Certified Engineers to those who seek highest ranked jobs in Telecom, Engineering, Data Analysis and Business'),
(4, 'about_us', '<p><br></p>'),
(10, 'terms_and_condition', '<h1><span class=\"selected\">Terms and Conditions</span></h1><p><strong>Last Updated: Aug 06, 2025</strong></p><p><strong>1. Introduction</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nWelcome to My-Communication Academy. These Terms and Conditions (\"Terms\") govern your access to and use of our website, courses, and related services (collectively, the \"Services\"). By enrolling in our courses or using our Services, you agree to be bound by these Terms.</span></p><p><strong>2. Company Information</strong><span class=\"selected\"> My-Communication Academy is operated by </span><strong>My-Communication Academy LTD</strong><span class=\"selected\">, registered in </span><strong>London, United Kingdom</strong><span class=\"selected\"> under company number </span><strong>16103115</strong><span class=\"selected\">.</span></p><ul><li><p><strong>Registered Address:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> 71-75 Shelton Street, Covent Garden, London, United Kingdom WC2H 9JQ</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Contact Email:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> admin@my-communication.com</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Contact Phone:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> +447474626313</span></p></li></ul><p><strong>3. User Accounts</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nTo access most features of the Services, you must register for an account. You agree to:</span></p><ul><li><p><span class=\"selected\">Provide accurate, current, and complete information during registration.</span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"selected\">Maintain the security of your password and accept all risks of unauthorized access to your account.</span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"selected\">Notify us immediately if you discover or suspect any security breaches.</span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"selected\">Not share your account credentials with any third party. Sharing an account is a violation of these Terms and may result in immediate suspension or termination of your Services without a refund.</span></p></li></ul><p><strong>4. Subscription and Payment</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Enrollment:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> You can enroll in our courses by completing the registration process and paying the applicable fees through our website.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Payment Methods:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> We accept payments via major Credit Cards and PayPal. All transactions are processed through secure third-party payment gateways. We do not store your full credit card information on our servers.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Free Consultation:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> New subscribers may request a complimentary consultation with a technical engineer to discuss their learning objectives.</span></p></li></ul><p><strong>5. Student Obligations and Code of Conduct</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nAs a user of our Services, you agree to:</span></p><ul><li><p><strong>Academic Integrity:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> Complete all assignments, projects, and exams honestly and individually.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Active Participation:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> Engage constructively in discussions, weekly meetings, and other collaborative activities.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Professional Conduct:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> Interact with instructors and fellow students respectfully and professionally. Harassment, discrimination, hate speech, or any disruptive behavior is strictly prohibited and will lead to immediate termination of your account without a refund.</span></p></li></ul><p><strong>6. Intellectual Property</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nAll course materials—including but not limited to videos, lectures, presentations, documents, and software—are the exclusive intellectual property of My-Communication Academy and its licensors. Your enrollment grants you a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to access and use the course materials for your personal, non-commercial educational purposes only.\r\nYou are strictly prohibited from:</span></p><ul><li><p><span class=\"selected\">Reproducing, distributing, selling, or publicly displaying any course materials.</span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"selected\">Creating derivative works based on our content.</span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"selected\">Sharing or leaking course materials.\r\nWe reserve the right to take legal action against any individual who violates this policy.</span></p></li></ul><p><strong>7. Policies</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nYour use of the Services is also governed by the following policies, which are incorporated by reference into these Terms:</span></p><ul><li><p><strong>Refund Policy:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> Governs the terms of course refunds.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Privacy Policy:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> Explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal data.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Cookies Policy:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> Describes our use of cookies and how you can manage them.</span></p></li></ul><p><strong>8. Modification of Terms</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nWe reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. We will provide notice of significant changes by updating the \"Last Updated\" date and, where appropriate, through email. Your continued use of the Services after such changes constitutes your acceptance of the new Terms.</span></p><p><strong>9. Governing Law and Jurisdiction</strong><span class=\"selected\"> These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of </span><strong>United Kingdom</strong><span class=\"selected\">. Any disputes arising from these Terms will be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of </span><strong>London</strong><span class=\"selected\">.</span></p>'),
(11, 'privacy_policy', '<h1><span class=\"selected\">Privacy Policy</span></h1><p><strong>Last Updated: Aug 06, 2025</strong></p><p><strong>1. Introduction</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nMy-Communication Academy (\"we,\" \"us,\" or \"our\") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you use our Services. This policy is drafted to comply with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).</span></p><p><strong>2. Data Controller</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nThe data controller responsible for your personal information is:</span></p><ul><li><p><strong>My-Communication Academy LTD</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Registered Address:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> 71-75 Shelton Street, Covent Garden, London, United Kingdom WC2H 9JQ</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Email:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> admin@my-communication.com</span></p></li></ul><p><strong>3. Information We Collect</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nWe may collect the following types of personal data:</span></p><ul><li><p><strong>Personal Identification Information:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> Name, email address, phone number, country of residence.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Payment Information:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> We do not store your credit card details. This information is collected and processed directly by our third-party payment processors (e.g., PayPal, Stripe), who are GDPR compliant.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Course and Usage Data:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> Information about your course progress, quiz results, project submissions, and interactions with our platform.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Technical Data:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> IP address, browser type, device information, and operating system. For more details, see our </span><strong>Cookies Policy</strong><span class=\"selected\">.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Communications:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> Any information you provide when you contact our support team.</span></p></li></ul><p><strong>4. How We Use Your Information</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nWe use your data for the following purposes:</span></p><ul><li><p><strong>To Provide and Manage Services:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> To create your account, enroll you in courses, and track your progress.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>To Process Payments:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> To facilitate transactions for course enrollment.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>To Communicate With You:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> To send service-related announcements, respond to inquiries, and provide support.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>To Improve Our Services:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> To analyze usage data to understand how our services are used and how we can improve them.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>For Legal and Security Purposes:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> To prevent fraud, enforce our Terms and Conditions, and comply with legal obligations.</span></p></li></ul><p><strong>5. Legal Basis for Processing (GDPR)</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nOur legal basis for processing your personal data includes:</span></p><ul><li><p><strong>Performance of a Contract:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> To fulfill our contractual obligations when you purchase a course.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Legitimate Interests:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> To improve our services and for security purposes, provided these interests do not override your rights.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Consent:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> For sending marketing communications, where you have explicitly opted in. You can withdraw your consent at any time.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Legal Obligation:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> To comply with applicable laws and regulations.</span></p></li></ul><p><strong>6. Data Sharing and Disclosure</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nWe do not sell your personal data. We may share your information with:</span></p><ul><li><p><strong>Service Providers:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> Third-party vendors who perform services on our behalf, such as payment processing and web hosting.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Instructors:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> To provide academic support and feedback.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Legal Authorities:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> If required by law or to protect the rights and safety of our users and the public.</span></p></li></ul><p><strong>7. Data Security</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nWe implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal data from unauthorized access, use, or disclosure.</span></p><p><strong>8. Your Rights Under GDPR</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nYou have the following rights regarding your personal data:</span></p><ul><li><p><strong>The right to access:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> You can request copies of your personal data.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>The right to rectification:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> You can request that we correct any information you believe is inaccurate.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>The right to erasure:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> You can request that we erase your personal data, under certain conditions.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>The right to restrict processing:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> You can request that we restrict the processing of your data.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>The right to object to processing:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> You can object to our processing of your data.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>The right to data portability:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> You can request that we transfer the data we have collected to another organization, or directly to you.</span></p></li></ul><p><span class=\"selected\">To exercise these rights, please contact our Data Protection Officer at </span><strong>admin@my-communication.com</strong><span class=\"selected\">.</span></p><p><strong>9. Contact Us</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nIf you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at </span><strong>admin@my-communication.com</strong><span class=\"selected\">.</span></p>'),
