(25, 'refund_policy', '<h1><span class=\"selected\">Refund Policy</span></h1><p><strong>Last Updated: Aug 06, 2025</strong></p><p><strong>1. Our Commitment</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nAt My-Communication Academy, we are dedicated to providing a high-quality and effective learning experience. This Refund Policy outlines the terms and conditions under which refunds are processed, in compliance with European Union consumer protection standards.</span></p><p><strong>2. Right of Withdrawal (14-Day Cooling-Off Period)</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nIn accordance with EU law, you have the right to withdraw from your course purchase within </span><strong>14 calendar days</strong><span class=\"selected\"> from the date of your transaction without providing a reason. If you exercise this right, you are entitled to a full refund of the fee paid.</span></p><p><strong>3. Eligibility for a Refund</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nTo be eligible for a full refund under the 14-day cooling-off period, you must:</span></p><ul><li><p><span class=\"selected\">Submit your refund request within 14 days of the original purchase date.</span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"selected\">Not have completed more than </span><strong>25%</strong><span class=\"selected\"> of the course content. Accessing a significant portion of the material is considered consumption of the service.</span></p></li></ul><p><strong>4. How to Request a Refund</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nTo request a refund, you must send a clear, written request to our dedicated support team.</span></p><ul><li><p><strong>Email:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> </span><strong>admin@my-communication.com</strong><span class=\"selected\">.</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Required Information:</strong><span class=\"selected\"> Please include your full name, the email address used for registration, the course title, and the order/transaction number.</span></p></li></ul><p><span class=\"selected\">We will process your request within 7-10 business days. Once approved, the refund will be issued to your original payment method.</span></p><p><strong>5. Applicable Courses</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nThis refund policy applies specifically to the following courses:</span></p><ul><li><p><span class=\"selected\">Integrated Telecommunications Engineering Course</span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"selected\">Wireless Communications Course</span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"selected\">Optical Transmission Course</span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"selected\">Microwave Transmission Course</span></p></li></ul><p><strong>6. After the Cooling-Off Period</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nAfter the 14-day period has expired, you are no longer eligible for a refund. We believe this period provides sufficient time to evaluate the course and our platform. Exceptions are not granted beyond this timeframe.</span></p><p><strong>7. Contact Us</strong><span class=\"selected\">\r\nFor any questions regarding this Refund Policy, please contact us at </span><strong>admin@my-communication.com</strong><span class=\"selected\">.</span></p>'),
