(37, 'website_faqs', '{\"0\":{\"question\":\"Who are these courses designed for?\",\"answer\":\"Our courses are ideal for engineering students seeking practical skills, working professionals looking to upskill or advance their careers, and anyone passionate about entering the telecommunications and ICT fields.\"},\"2\":{\"question\":\"What are your most popular courses?\",\"answer\":\"Our flagship program is the Integrated Telecommunication Engineering course. We also offer specialized, in-depth courses in Wireless Communications, Optical Fiber Transmission, Microwave Transmission, and new cutting-edge programs in Data Science, Machine Learning, and Computer Vision.\"},\"3\":{\"question\":\"What makes My-Communication Academy different from other platforms?\",\"answer\":\"We focus on practical, job-ready skills. Our key differentiators include lifetime access to course updates, weekly interactive sessions with expert instructors, dedicated career advancement training, and mandatory capstone projects that simulate real-world work.\"},\"4\":{\"question\":\"How do I enroll in a course?\",\"answer\":\"You can enroll directly through our website. Simply choose your course and follow the steps to complete your registration and payment securely using a major Credit Card or PayPal.\"},\"5\":{\"question\":\"Is there a free trial?\",\"answer\":\"While we don\'t offer a traditional free trial, we provide a 14-day money-back guarantee. This allows you to enroll with confidence and explore the course content to ensure it\'s the right fit for you.\"},\"6\":{\"question\":\"What is your refund policy?\",\"answer\":\"You are entitled to a full refund within 14 days of your purchase, provided you have not completed more than 25% of the course content. To request a refund, simply send an email to our support team.\"},\"7\":{\"question\":\"Are there flexible payment options?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, we accept major credit cards and PayPal. For students in regions that face challenges with online payments, we also support bank transfers. Please contact our customer service for assistance.\"},\"8\":{\"question\":\"What kind of support can I expect during my studies?\",\"answer\":\"We offer comprehensive student support, including weekly live technical sessions with our expert trainers, 24\\/7 customer service for six months, and access to a community of fellow learners. Our goal is to ensure you have the guidance you need to succeed.\"},\"9\":{\"question\":\"Are the instructors experienced?\",\"answer\":\"Absolutely. Our trainers are highly experienced industry professionals from top telecommunications companies. They bring years of practical, real-world knowledge to their teaching, ensuring the content is relevant and up-to-date.\"},\"10\":{\"question\":\"Can I access the courses on my phone or tablet?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. Our platform and courses are fully optimized for all devices, including desktops, tablets, and mobile phones, so you can learn anytime, anywhere.\"},\"11\":{\"question\":\"Will these courses actually help me get a job?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. Beyond technical training, we provide dedicated career advancement support, including resume writing workshops, LinkedIn profile optimization, and simulated job interviews to prepare you for the job market.\"},\"12\":{\"question\":\"Are the certificates recognized professionally?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. We partner with accredited academic institutions and professional engineering bodies to offer globally recognized certificates. This enhances your professional credibility and value to employers.\"},\"13\":{\"question\":\"How do I receive my certificate?\",\"answer\":\"Upon successful completion of your course and any required projects, you will receive a free electronic certificate via our website. Printed and accredited copies are also available upon request.\"}}'),
