(946, 'Final Exam', NULL, 15, 61, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1782680400, 1782853200, 'text', '&lt;p&gt;Distance: 20 km for both route (G.652)&lt;br&gt;Fiber loss: 0.2, 5dB margin&lt;br&gt;Protection: (client side)ponder(line side)+OLP/DCP, M520SM&lt;br&gt;One 9800 M12 for east, one 9800 M12 for west, RACK separate for each M12 at AQ&lt;br&gt;The ponder can be inserted in the 2 x M12&lt;br&gt;Capacity: 2x100GE&lt;br&gt;Line rate: 200G&lt;br&gt;96 system, start with 40, upgrade to 96 smoothly without service affected&lt;br&gt;ROADM, if needed for CDC&lt;br&gt;Keep OD and FD at first design&lt;br&gt;Managed by existing NCE on Saudi and Jordan, separate manage&lt;br&gt;Client side module 5KM&lt;br&gt;OPEX 5 years&lt;/p&gt;', 'description', NULL, '', 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL),
