(1, 220, '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-682609bb-7fff-1d4a-2a30-eaee772edd98&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;1. All types of frequency spectrum have the same propagation methods.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 'single_choice', 2, '[\" - True\",\"- False  \"]', '[\"2\"]', 0),
(2, 220, '&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;2. Do cellular wireless communications have the same network structure as satellite communications?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'single_choice', 2, '[\" - True\",\"- False  \"]', '[\"2\"]', 0),
(3, 220, '&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;3. Were SMS (text messages) available starting from the first-generation technology?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'single_choice', 2, '[\" - True\",\" - False  \"]', '[\"2\"]', 0),
(4, 220, '&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;4. Can we send signals on the same sector for three different technologies (2G/3G/4G) in the wireless network by using different bandwidths for each technology?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'single_choice', 2, '[\" - True\",\" - False  \"]', '[\"1\"]', 0),
(5, 220, '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;5. Is one of the benefits of MIMO technology the expansion of coverage range?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'single_choice', 2, '[\" - True\",\" - False  \"]', '[\"2\"]', 0),
(6, 220, '&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;6. Which section is considered the heart of the network in telecommunications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-7a4f2bad-7fff-b361-8f00-2d8fec0d975d&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'multiple_choice', 3, '[\" Base Band Unit\",\"  Transmission\",\"  Core Network  \"]', '[\"3\"]', 0),
(8, 220, '&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;7. Which technologies are used in the third generation (3G):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-0bf4dc61-7fff-bf56-b275-9b6d569b73bf&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'multiple_choice', 3, '[\"  - FH + CDMA\",\" - WCDMA + FH + Spread spectrum\",\"  - CDMA only  \"]', '[\"2\"]', 0),
(9, 220, '&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;8. How are DL and UL signals transmitted in wireless communications using FDD technology?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-096c7dff-7fff-e421-28ca-d5e334bcd0f5&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'multiple_choice', 3, '[\"   - They are sent on the same frequency\",\"   - They are sent on different frequencies\",\"   - They are sent at the same time and simultaneously  \"]', '[\"2\"]', 0),
(10, 220, '&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight:normal;&quot; id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-ed100a29-7fff-e04c-8463-17c55de3a979&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;9. If we have a bandwidth of 10MHz, how many carriers are available for each technology?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'multiple_choice', 3, '[\"   - 8 carriers of 2G, 2 carriers of 3G, 1 carrier of 4G\",\"- 1 carrier of 2G, 5 carriers of 3G, 3 carriers of 4G\",\"   - 6 carriers of 2G, 2 carriers of 3G, 1 carrier of 4G  \"]', '[\"1\"]', 0),
(11, 220, '&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;10. What are the main benefits of using 1T2R technology for improvement?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-de4df425-7fff-4e16-17d2-ec5bf2600321&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.295;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'multiple_choice', 3, '[\"   - Signal quality\",\"   - Signal speed\",\"   - Signal strength  \"]', '[\"1\"]', 0),
(12, 259, '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-AE&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:\r\n107%;font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-ansi-language:#4C09;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;Is\r\nthe BBU part of the Telecom section in the wireless communication tower?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'single_choice', 2, '[\"True\",\"False\"]', '[\"1\"]', 0),
