(22, 260, '&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-AE&quot;&gt;. It is not possible to provide the same\r\ncoverage area for all technologies used in the communication tower.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'single_choice', 2, '[\"True\",\"False\"]', '[\"1\"]', 0),
(23, 260, '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-AE&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:\r\n107%;font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-ansi-language:#4C09;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;.\r\nFSPL(dBm) = 20log(d) + 20log(f) + 92.45 when f = Hz, d = meters. Is this\r\nformula correct?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'single_choice', 2, '[\"True\",\"False\"]', '[\"2\"]', 0),
