(6, 'Amir', 'Magdy', '00962782626313', '00962782626313', 'admin@my-communication.com', '8a833fe5fd0b9708f1de3c002b1ab27fc817b1ca', '', '{\"facebook\":\"\",\"twitter\":\"\",\"linkedin\":\"\"}', '<p>The 5G Core trainer has more than 10 years of professional experience in communications networks and voice technologies (CS/IMS/Fixed/VoWIFI) and has worked in major organizations in Egypt, where he has assumed leadership and management responsibilities for the largest strategic projects in the region.</p><p>With more than a decade of hands-on experience in advanced communication networks as well as comprehensive knowledge of 4G/5G networks, the 5G Core course instructor is a reliable reference for understanding 5G technologies and their applications in practice. It is distinguished by its accurate understanding of the 5G architecture and its ability to connect theoretical concepts with the practical applications it encounters daily in the field of communications.</p><p><br></p><p>His most prominent qualifications and skills:</p><p><br></p><p>Voice services management (VoLTE/VoWWI) and integration with 5G technologies.</p><p><br></p><p>Design platforms such as MSCS and MGW and understand 5G Core networks.</p><p><br></p><p>Analyze issues using performance indicators to optimize networks.</p><p><br></p><p>Equipping trainees with the skills required for the labor market in 5G networks.</p><p>Academic Qualifications:</p><p>He holds a bachelor\'s degree in communications and information technology engineering from Helwan University and UNINETTUNO International University, Rome, Italy, in addition to completing an outstanding graduation project in the design and implementation of the Open BTS system for simulating GSM networks.</p><div><br></div>', 2, 1754579915, 1757179608, '[]', '', '{\"paypal\":{\"sandbox_client_id\":\"\",\"sandbox_secret_key\":\"\",\"production_client_id\":\"\",\"production_secret_key\":\"\"},\"stripe\":{\"public_key\":\"312\",\"secret_key\":\"2213\",\"publi