(7, 'Hanan ', 'Saleh', 'hanansaleh314@gmail.com', '+962 7 8519 4322', 'hanansaleh314@gmail.com', '8a833fe5fd0b9708f1de3c002b1ab27fc817b1ca', '', '{\"facebook\":\"\",\"twitter\":\"\",\"linkedin\":\"\"}', '<p>Eng. Hanan Saleh, an expert in the field of communications and electronics, has more than 10 years of experience in training engineering cadres, and has certifications approved by Cisco and Microsoft, in addition to a trainer certified by the Ministry of Labor. It is considered a reference in the field of training in modern communication technologies.</p><div><br></div>', 2, 1754657696, NULL, '[]', NULL, '{\"paypal\":{\"sandbox_client_id\":\"\",\"sandbox_secret_key\":\"\",\"production_client_id\":\"\",\"production_secret_key\":\"\"},\"stripe\":{\"public_key\":\"2211\",\"secret_key\":\"254\",\"public_live_key\":\"2210\",\"secret_live_key\":\"253\"},\"razorpay\":{\"key_id\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"theme_color\":\"\"},\"xendit\":{\"api_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"other_parameter\":\"\"},\"payu\":{\"pos_id\":\"\",\"second_key\":\"\",\"client_id\":\"\",\"client_secret\":\"\"},\"pagseguro\":{\"api_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"other_parameter\":\"\"},\"sslcommerz\":{\"store_id\":\"\",\"store_password\":\"\"},\"skrill\":{\"skrill_merchant_email\":\"\",\"secret_passphrase\":\"\"},\"doku\":{\"client_id\":\"\",\"shared_key\":\"\"},\"bkash\":{\"app_key\":\"\",\"app_secret\":\"\",\"username\":\"hanansaleh314@gmail.com\",\"password\":\"\"},\"cashfree\":{\"client_id\":\"\",\"client_secret\":\"\"},\"maxicash\":{\"merchant_id\":\"\",\"merchant_password\":\"\"},\"aamarpay\":{\"store_id\":\"\",\"signature_key\":\"\"},\"flutterwave\":{\"public_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\"},\"tazapay\":{\"public_key\":\"\",\"api_key\":\"\",\"api_secret\":\"\"}}', NULL, 1, 1, '5c71c81de0811affc7f7a2d3eea92cbc', NULL, '', NULL, NULL),
(8, 'Samah', 'Ebrahim', 'Technical.SAbdo-Ebrahim@My-communication.net', '+20 12 07632719', 'Technical.SAbdo-Ebrahim@My-communication.net', '8a833fe5fd0b9708f1de3c002b1ab27fc817b1ca', '', '{\"facebook\":\"\",\"twitter\":\"\",\"linkedin\":\"\"}', '<p>The trainer holds a master\'s degree in data science and artificial intelligence.</p><p>She has more than three years of hands-on experience in AI as a freelancer.</p><p>We have a strong background in developing and applying AI solutions across industries</p><p>She has experience in teaching technical concepts to beginners and professionals.</p><p>Besides her academic and professional experience, the trainer has training skills such as</p><p>The ability to simplify technical concepts and present them in an easy-to-understand manner for all levels.</p><p>Hands-on experience in training on AI applications and data analysis.</p><p>Use modern teaching methods including interactive learning, hands-on projects, and real-world case studies.</p><p>Effective communication skills that allow him to interact with students and respond to their inquiries in a clear and professional manner.</p><p>Providing up-to-date training content based on the latest research and developments in the field of artificial intelligence.</p><div><br></div>', 2, 1754658580, NULL, '[]', NULL, '{\"paypal\":{\"sandbox_client_id\":\"\",\"sandbox_secret_key\":\"\",\"production_client_id\":\"\",\"production_secret_key\":\"\"},\"stripe\":{\"public_key\":\"7576\",\"secret_key\":\"889\",\"public_live_key\":\"7575\",\"secret_live_key\":\"888\"},\"razorpay\":{\"key_id\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"theme_color\":\"\"},\"xendit\":{\"api_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"other_parameter\":\"\"},\"payu\":{\"pos_id\":\"\",\"second_key\":\"\",\"client_id\":\"\",\"client_secret\":\"\"},\"pagseguro\":{\"api_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"other_parameter\":\"\"},\"sslcommerz\":{\"store_id\":\"\",\"store_password\":\"\"},\"skrill\":{\"skrill_merchant_email\":\"\",\"secret_passphrase\":\"\"},\"doku\":{\"client_id\":\"\",\"shared_key\":\"\"},\"bkash\":{\"app_key\":\"\",\"app_secret\":\"\",\"username\":\"Technical.SAbdo-Ebrahim@My-communication.net\",\"password\":\"\"},\"cashfree\":{\"client_id\":\"\",\"client_secret\":\"\"},\"maxicash\":{\"merchant_id\":\"\",\"merchant_password\":\"\"},\"aamarpay\":{\"store_id\":\"\",\"signature_key\":\"\"},\"flutterwave\":{\"public_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\"},\"tazapay\":{\"public_key\":\"\",\"api_key\":\"\",\"api_secret\":\"\"}}', NULL, 1, 1, 'c18680b1840f8655b99191ab18602251', NULL, '', NULL, NULL),
(9, ' Fatima ', 'Nasr Salem', 'nsrfatima337@gmail.com', '+218 92-3689415', 'nsrfatima337@gmail.com', '8a833fe5fd0b9708f1de3c002b1ab27fc817b1ca', '', '{\"facebook\":\"\",\"twitter\":\"\",\"linkedin\":\"\"}', '<p>Eng. Fatima Nasr Salem is a Communications Engineer with extensive experience in the telecommunications sector and training of technical personnel.</p><p>  It is characterized by a training style that combines practical and applied science, and its ability to simplify complex concepts for its students effectively and skillfully.</p><p> The most important academic and professional certificates in her career:</p><p>● Bachelor of Communication Engineering</p><p>● Certified Trainer from the Communications Academy</p><p>● Certificates in Mobile Technologies (2G, 3G, 4G, 5G) from Etisalat Academy</p><p>● 5G HCIA certification from Huawei</p><p>● TOT (PROFESSIONAL TRAINER) CERTIFIED U.S. CBA certified and licensed by Oxford</p><p>● Advanced Certificates in Microwave and Fiber Optic Transmission Systems from Etisalat Academy</p><p><br></p>', 2, 1754658823, NULL, '[]', NULL, '{\"paypal\":{\"sandbox_client_id\":\"\",\"sandbox_secret_key\":\"\",\"production_client_id\":\"\",\"production_secret_key\":\"\"},\"stripe\":{\"public_key\":\"4255\",\"secret_key\":\"878\",\"public_live_key\":\"4244\",\"secret_live_key\":\"979\"},\"razorpay\":{\"key_id\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"theme_color\":\"\"},\"xendit\":{\"api_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"other_parameter\":\"\"},\"payu\":{\"pos_id\":\"\",\"second_key\":\"\",\"client_id\":\"\",\"client_secret\":\"\"},\"pagseguro\":{\"api_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"other_parameter\":\"\"},\"sslcommerz\":{\"store_id\":\"\",\"store_password\":\"\"},\"skrill\":{\"skrill_merchant_email\":\"\",\"secret_passphrase\":\"\"},\"doku\":{\"client_id\":\"\",\"shared_key\":\"\"},\"bkash\":{\"app_key\":\"\",\"app_secret\":\"\",\"username\":\"nsrfatima337@gmail.com\",\"password\":\"\"},\"cashfree\":{\"client_id\":\"\",\"client_secret\":\"\"},\"maxicash\":{\"merchant_id\":\"\",\"merchant_password\":\"\"},\"aamarpay\":{\"store_id\":\"\",\"signature_key\":\"\"},\"flutterwave\":{\"public_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\"},\"tazapay\":{\"public_key\":\"\",\"api_key\":\"\",\"api_secret\":\"\"}}', NULL, 1, 1, '777ab8095b646b3109a6ff60eb7c8d96', NULL, '', NULL, NULL),
(10, ' Mohamed', ' Abdel Qader Al-Damour', 'm.dmour.jmc@gmail.com', '00962799027896', ' m.dmour.jmc@gmail.com', '8a833fe5fd0b9708f1de3c002b1ab27fc817b1ca', '', '{\"facebook\":\"\",\"twitter\":\"\",\"linkedin\":\"\"}', '<p><br></p><p>Communications and satellite broadcasting expert with more than 20 years of experience</p><p><br></p><p>He is currently the Assistant Director of the Satellite Broadcasting Sector at the Jordan Media City. </p><p><br></p><p>He is responsible for transmitting more than 450 television channels and 60 radio channels via satellite and the Internet.</p><p><br></p><p>He has extensive experience in designing and executing telecommunications and satellite broadcasting projects and leading technical and administrative teams.</p><p><br></p><p>He is a certified consultant to many entities, most notably the Jordanian Ministry of Justice and the international company Guidepoint.</p><p><br></p><p>He has supervised the planning and implementation of major projects in broadcasting and FM systems, and has a prominent role in the expansion of electronic systems and the provision of satellite internet services. </p><p><br></p><p>He is a certified trainer in GPS/GIS systems and satellite communications, and has participated in many technical and management courses with international companies such as Harmonic, Ericson and Cisco.</p><p><br></p><p>Known for his strategic vision, his ability to solve complex problems, evaluate performance, and lead teams efficiently, making him a trusted reference in the field of communications and satellite broadcasting.</p><div><br></div>', 2, 1754663424, NULL, '[]', NULL, '{\"paypal\":{\"sandbox_client_id\":\"\",\"sandbox_secret_key\":\"\",\"production_client_id\":\"\",\"production_secret_key\":\"\"},\"stripe\":{\"public_key\":\"5577\",\"secret_key\":\"334\",\"public_live_key\":\"332\",\"secret_live_key\":\"686\"},\"razorpay\":{\"key_id\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"theme_color\":\"\"},\"xendit\":{\"api_key\":\"\",\"secret_k