(11, ' Ibrahim', ' Abdelrahman ', 'Ibrahimnabil87@gmail.com', '+2 01275329544', 'Ibrahimnabil87@gmail.com', '8a833fe5fd0b9708f1de3c002b1ab27fc817b1ca', '', '{\"facebook\":\"\",\"twitter\":\"\",\"linkedin\":\"\"}', '<p>Experience: 11+ years in telecommunications.</p><p>Work Experience:</p><p>Functional Manager at Huawei.</p><p>Certified Trainer in Mobile Networks.</p><p>Founder of a specialized YouTube channel (Ibrahim Abd El Rahman for Mobile Networks).</p><p>Certifications: Cyber Information Security (Huawei), PLC, SCADA, GSM, Matlab.</p><p>Enterprises: Mobiserve, Huawei.</p><div><br></div>', 2, 1754684253, 1754685023, '[]', '', '{\"paypal\":{\"sandbox_client_id\":\"\",\"sandbox_secret_key\":\"\",\"production_client_id\":\"\",\"production_secret_key\":\"\"},\"stripe\":{\"public_key\":\"576\",\"secret_key\":\"333\",\"public_live_key\":\"2445\",\"secret_live_key\":\"465\"},\"razorpay\":{\"key_id\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"theme_color\":\"\"},\"xendit\":{\"api_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"other_parameter\":\"\"},\"payu\":{\"pos_id\":\"\",\"second_key\":\"\",\"client_id\":\"\",\"client_secret\":\"\"},\"pagseguro\":{\"api_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"other_parameter\":\"\"},\"sslcommerz\":{\"store_id\":\"\",\"store_password\":\"\"},\"skrill\":{\"skrill_merchant_email\":\"\",\"secret_passphrase\":\"\"},\"doku\":{\"client_id\":\"\",\"shared_key\":\"\"},\"bkash\":{\"app_key\":\"\",\"app_secret\":\"\",\"username\":\"Ibrahimnabil87@gmail.com\",\"password\":\"\"},\"cashfree\":{\"client_id\":\"\",\"client_secret\":\"\"},\"maxicash\":{\"merchant_id\":\"\",\"merchant_password\":\"\"},\"aamarpay\":{\"store_id\":\"\",\"signature_key\":\"\"},\"flutterwave\":{\"public_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\"},\"tazapay\":{\"public_key\":\"\",\"api_key\":\"\",\"api_secret\":\"\"}}', NULL, 1, 1, '52e00166528656fb79ca64d84299f985', NULL, '', NULL, NULL),
(12, 'Mohamed', ' Taj', 'mohamed.taggeldeen@gmail.com', '+2 01024901792', 'mohamed.taggeldeen@gmail.com', '8a833fe5fd0b9708f1de3c002b1ab27fc817b1ca', '', '{\"facebook\":\"\",\"twitter\":\"\",\"linkedin\":\"\"}', '<p><br></p><p>Experience: 12+ years in telecommunications.</p><p>Work Experience:</p><p>Team Leader at Huawei.</p><p>Founder of a mobile contracting company.</p><p>Certified trainer in BTS and Transmission equipment.</p><p>Certifications: Transmission Equipment & BTS (Huawei), GSM, Matlab.</p><p>Companies: Alkan Network, Afro Egypt, Huawei.</p><div><br></div>', 2, 1754686100, NULL, '[]', NULL, '{\"paypal\":{\"sandbox_client_id\":\"\",\"sandbox_secret_key\":\"\",\"production_client_id\":\"\",\"production_secret_key\":\"\"},\"stripe\":{\"public_key\":\"467\",\"secret_key\":\"888\",\"public_live_key\":\"545\",\"secret_live_key\":\"223\"},\"razorpay\":{\"key_id\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"theme_color\":\"\"},\"xendit\":{\"api_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"other_parameter\":\"\"},\"payu\":{\"pos_id\":\"\",\"second_key\":\"\",\"client_id\":\"\",\"client_secret\":\"\"},\"pagseguro\":{\"api_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"other_parameter\":\"\"},\"sslcommerz\":{\"store_id\":\"\",\"store_password\":\"\"},\"skrill\":{\"skrill_merchant_email\":\"\",\"secret_passphrase\":\"\"},\"doku\":{\"client_id\":\"\",\"shared_key\":\"\"},\"bkash\":{\"app_key\":\"\",\"app_secret\":\"\",\"username\":\"admin@mycommunication.com\",\"password\":\"\"},\"cashfree\":{\"client_id\":\"\",\"client_secret\":\"\"},\"maxicash\":{\"merchant_id\":\"\",\"merchant_password\":\"\"},\"aamarpay\":{\"store_id\":\"\",\"signature_key\":\"\"},\"flutterwave\":{\"public_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\"},\"tazapay\":{\"public_key\":\"\",\"api_key\":\"\",\"api_secret\":\"\"}}', NULL, 1, 1, '85c50d582c58cfaf58e0c2b2bd95643f', NULL, '', NULL, NULL),
(13, 'Ahmed', ' Fadl ', 'ahmed.fadl@ericsson.com', '', 'ahmed.fadl@ericsson.com ', '8a833fe5fd0b9708f1de3c002b1ab27fc817b1ca', '', '{\"facebook\":\"\",\"twitter\":\"\",\"linkedin\":\"\"}', '<p>Eng. Ahmed Fadl Abd El, Aziz</p><p>He is a graduate of the Faculty of Communication Engineering in Sudan and holds a master\'s degree in communication technology from Sikkim Manipal University.</p><p> He is currently working at Ericsson as a consultant in the planning and design of transportation networks and has also worked on a planning assignment</p><p>He is one of the first specialists in microwave network planning tools with 15 years of professional experience in the field of microwaves.</p><div><br></div>', 2, 1754686829, NULL, '[]', NULL, '{\"paypal\":{\"sandbox_client_id\":\"\",\"sandbox_secret_key\":\"\",\"production_client_id\":\"\",\"production_secret_key\":\"\"},\"stripe\":{\"public_key\":\"777\",\"secret_key\":\"3433\",\"public_live_key\":\"221\",\"secret_live_key\":\"122\"},\"razorpay\":{\"key_id\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"theme_color\":\"\"},\"xendit\":{\"api_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"other_parameter\":\"\"},\"payu\":{\"pos_id\":\"\",\"second_key\":\"\",\"client_id\":\"\",\"client_secret\":\"\"},\"pagseguro\":{\"api_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"other_parameter\":\"\"},\"sslcommerz\":{\"store_id\":\"\",\"store_password\":\"\"},\"skrill\":{\"skrill_merchant_email\":\"\",\"secret_passphrase\":\"\"},\"doku\":{\"client_id\":\"\",\"shared_key\":\"\"},\"bkash\":{\"app_key\":\"\",\"app_secret\":\"\",\"username\":\"admin@mycommunication.com\",\"password\":\"\"},\"cashfree\":{\"client_id\":\"\",\"client_secret\":\"\"},\"maxicash\":{\"merchant_id\":\"\",\"merchant_password\":\"\"},\"aamarpay\":{\"store_id\":\"\",\"signature_key\":\"\"},\"flutterwave\":{\"public_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\"},\"tazapay\":{\"public_key\":\"\",\"api_key\":\"\",\"api_secret\":\"\"}}', NULL, 1, 1, '1b15f47981923f2e928a5d2ee904e528', NULL, '', NULL, NULL),
(14, 'Abdullah ', 'Al-Shabasi', 'Abdullah.elshbasi@dhub-eg.com', '+201150120598', 'Abdullah.elshbasi@dhub-eg.com', '607ca2f210e72354cc5742fdb65ef91b3bf6ada8', '', '{\"facebook\":\"\",\"twitter\":\"\",\"linkedin\":\"\"}', '<p><br></p><p>Experience: Over 10 years in designing, implementing, and managing complex cloud solutions on GCP</p><p>Professional Background: He has worked as a Cloud Solutions Architect and Site Reliability Engineer (SRE) in leading companies locally and internationally.</p><p>Certifications: Holds advanced GCP certifications (Google Cloud Certified Professional Cloud Architect, Data Engineer, Security Engineer).</p><p>Training Approach: Focuses on the practical and applied aspect, linking concepts to real-world case studies, and providing best practices derived from field experience.</p><p>Goal: To enable trainees to achieve career success in cloud work environments.</p><div><br></div>', 2, 1754921545, NULL, '[]', NULL, '{\"paypal\":{\"sandbox_client_id\":\"\",\"sandbox_secret_key\":\"\",\"production_client_id\":\"\",\"production_secret_key\":\"\"},\"stripe\":{\"public_key\":\"24444\",\"secret_key\":\"3133\",\"public_live_key\":\"9654\",\"secret_live_key\":\"63\"},\"razorpay\":{\"key_id\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"theme_color\":\"\"},\"xendit\":{\"api_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"other_parameter\":\"\"},\"payu\":{\"pos_id\":\"\",\"second_key\":\"\",\"client_id\":\"\",\"client_secret\":\"\"},\"pagseguro\":{\"api_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"other_parameter\":\"\"},\"sslcommerz\":{\"store_id\":\"\",\"store_password\":\"\"},\"skrill\":{\"skrill_merchant_email\":\"\",\"secret_passphrase\":\"\"},\"doku\":{\"client_id\":\"\",\"shared_key\":\"\"},\"bkash\":{\"app_key\":\"\",\"app_secret\":\"\",\"username\":\"Abdullah.elshbasi@dhub-eg.com\",\"password\":\"\"},\"cashfree\":{\"client_id\":\"\",\"client_secret\":\"\"},\"maxicash\":{\"merchant_id\":\"\",\"merchant_password\":\"\"},\"aamarpay\":{\"store_id\":\"\",\"signature_key\":\"\"},\"flutterwav