(15, ' Hassan ', 'Shamkh', 'hassanshamkh21@gmail.com', '01125543733 ', ' hassanshamkh21@gmail.com', '607ca2f210e72354cc5742fdb65ef91b3bf6ada8', '', '{\"facebook\":\"\",\"twitter\":\"\",\"linkedin\":\"\"}', '<p>Eng. Hassan Shamkh is a computer network trainer with more than 7 years of experience in the field of training and network management </p><p>He has deep technical knowledge and is familiar with all modern networking concepts and is:</p><p>● FOUNDER OF HS NETWORKS ACADEMY, WHICH HAS MORE THAN 40,000 FOLLOWERS.</p><p>Specialized in CCNA, CCNP, NSE4 courses.</p><p>● Participated in university graduation projects and achieved advanced positions in Huawei ICT competitions. </p><div><br></div>', 2, 1754922018, NULL, '[]', NULL, '{\"paypal\":{\"sandbox_client_id\":\"\",\"sandbox_secret_key\":\"\",\"production_client_id\":\"\",\"production_secret_key\":\"\"},\"stripe\":{\"public_key\":\"4332\",\"secret_key\":\"98\",\"public_live_key\":\"7465\",\"secret_live_key\":\"655\"},\"razorpay\":{\"key_id\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"theme_color\":\"\"},\"xendit\":{\"api_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"other_parameter\":\"\"},\"payu\":{\"pos_id\":\"\",\"second_key\":\"\",\"client_id\":\"\",\"client_secret\":\"\"},\"pagseguro\":{\"api_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"other_parameter\":\"\"},\"sslcommerz\":{\"store_id\":\"\",\"store_password\":\"\"},\"skrill\":{\"skrill_merchant_email\":\"\",\"secret_passphrase\":\"\"},\"doku\":{\"client_id\":\"\",\"shared_key\":\"\"},\"bkash\":{\"app_key\":\"\",\"app_secret\":\"\",\"username\":\"mayaaballoul@gmail.com\",\"password\":\"\"},\"cashfree\":{\"client_id\":\"\",\"client_secret\":\"\"},\"maxicash\":{\"merchant_id\":\"\",\"merchant_password\":\"\"},\"aamarpay\":{\"store_id\":\"\",\"signature_key\":\"\"},\"flutterwave\":{\"public_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\"},\"tazapay\":{\"public_key\":\"\",\"api_key\":\"\",\"api_secret\":\"\"}}', NULL, 1, 1, '25cd9d44ffe684dcfba42466bc8cc6b9', NULL, '', NULL, NULL),
(16, 'Salah al-Din', ' al-Qurashi', 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/salaheldin-gourashi/', '+966569807698', 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/salaheldin-gourashi/', '607ca2f210e72354cc5742fdb65ef91b3bf6ada8', '', '{\"facebook\":\"\",\"twitter\":\"\",\"linkedin\":\"\"}', '<p><br></p><p>He is a trainer and cybersecurity expert with more than 4 years of practical experience, during which he has held several technical and consulting positions in prestigious organizations inside and outside the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia. </p><p><br></p><p>He has deep field experience in penetration testing, vulnerability management, and network security, along with strong training experience in delivering internationally accredited courses such as CompTIA, OffSec, and EC-Council.</p><p><br></p><p>He combines technical competence with the ability to simplify complex concepts for learners, making him an effective trainer with a clear impact on the development of national cadres in the field of cybersecurity.</p><p><br></p><p>Outstanding Professional Qualifications and Certificates</p><p><br></p><p>OSCP, OSWE, CRTO — Advanced Offensive Security Certifications  </p><p><br></p><p>CEH & PenTest — Professional Penetration Testing Certifications  </p><p><br></p><p>RHCSA — Certified Linux Systems Administrator  </p><p><br></p><p>Specialized certifications in application, networking, and cloud security (ACP, CAP, CNSP, MRCTA)  </p><p><br></p><p>International Bug Bounty Experience with HackerOne </p><div><br></div>', 2, 1754923509, NULL, '[]', NULL, '{\"paypal\":{\"sandbox_client_id\":\"\",\"sandbox_secret_key\":\"\",\"production_client_id\":\"\",\"production_secret_key\":\"\"},\"stripe\":{\"public_key\":\"345\",\"secret_key\":\"953\",\"public_live_key\":\"08753\",\"secret_live_key\":\"233\"},\"razorpay\":{\"key_id\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"theme_color\":\"\"},\"xendit\":{\"api_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"other_parameter\":\"\"},\"payu\":{\"pos_id\":\"\",\"second_key\":\"\",\"client_id\":\"\",\"client_secret\":\"\"},\"pagseguro\":{\"api_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"other_parameter\":\"\"},\"sslcommerz\":{\"store_id\":\"\",\"store_password\":\"\"},\"skrill\":{\"skrill_merchant_email\":\"\",\"secret_passphrase\":\"\"},\"doku\":{\"client_id\":\"\",\"shared_key\":\"\"},\"bkash\":{\"app_key\":\"\",\"app_secret\":\"\",\"username\":\"https:\\/\\/www.linkedin.com\\/in\\/salaheldin-gourashi\\/\",\"password\":\"\"},\"cashfree\":{\"client_id\":\"\",\"client_secret\":\"\"},\"maxicash\":{\"merchant_id\":\"\",\"merchant_password\":\"\"},\"aamarpay\":{\"store_id\":\"\",\"signature_key\":\"\"},\"flutterwave\":{\"public_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\"},\"tazapay\":{\"public_key\":\"\",\"api_key\":\"\",\"api_secret\":\"\"}}', NULL, 1, 1, '91ef081acca5e30006a33ec7c01044cb', NULL, '', NULL, NULL),
(17, 'Ahmed', ' Qaiser', 'ahmad.kaisarr@gmail.com', '(+963) 932659932', 'ahmad.kaisarr@gmail.com', '607ca2f210e72354cc5742fdb65ef91b3bf6ada8', '', '{\"facebook\":\"\",\"twitter\":\"\",\"linkedin\":\"\"}', '<p>Eng. Ahmed Qaiser is a trainer specialized in the field of computer networks and cybersecurity.</p><p>He has more than 10 years of hands-on experience in teaching and managing networks.</p><p>He holds a bachelor\'s degree in computer engineering and automation from Damascus University, in addition to a master\'s degree in robotics engineering from the same university.</p><p>Specializes in training Cisco certified courses such as CCNA and CCNA Security, as well as courses in server management and operating systems such as MCSE (Windows Server 2012 Management). </p><p>He has taught a wide range of networking courses such as Network+ and MVPNsCSE</p><p>He has extensive experience in designing, managing and protecting networks using tools such as firewalls and VPNs.</p><div><br></div>', 2, 1754924592, NULL, '[]', NULL, '{\"paypal\":{\"sandbox_client_id\":\"\",\"sandbox_secret_key\":\"\",\"production_client_id\":\"\",\"production_secret_key\":\"\"},\"stripe\":{\"public_key\":\"t766\",\"secret_key\":\"7yy\",\"public_live_key\":\"98u\",\"secret_live_key\":\"555\"},\"razorpay\":{\"key_id\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"theme_color\":\"\"},\"xendit\":{\"api_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"other_parameter\":\"\"},\"payu\":{\"pos_id\":\"\",\"second_key\":\"\",\"client_id\":\"\",\"client_secret\":\"\"},\"pagseguro\":{\"api_key\":\"\",\"secret_key\":\"\",\"other_parameter\":\"\"},\"sslcommerz\":{\"store_id\":\"\",\"store_password\":\"\"},\"skrill\":{\"skrill_merchant_email\":\"\",\"secret_passphrase\":\"\"},\"doku\":{\"client_id\":\"\",\"shared_key\":\"\"},\"bkash\":{\"app_key\":\"\",\"app_secret\":\"\",\"username\":\"ahmad.kaisarr@gmail.com\",\"password\":\"\"},\"cashfree\":{\"client_id\":\"\",\"client_secret\":\"\"},\"maxicash\":{\"merchant_id\":\"\",\"merchant_password\":\